{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":499574,"name":"Constantin Philippou","username":"conszi","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/conszi/{size}/121972_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-24T01:41:50.227Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-499574-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-499574-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-499574-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-499574-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eApp:\u003c/strong\u003e Grok Bot desktop (Windows)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDragging the vertical divider between the chat pane and the agent computer / right info pane all the way to the right collapses/hides the right pane. After that, there is no monitor / computer icon in the top-right (or elsewhere) to reopen it. The old monitor affordance appears to have been removed or moved, so a fully collapsed pane is a dead end.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eActual:\u003c/strong\u003e Pane disappears; no monitor icon; the user must use workarounds to restore access.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-499574-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-499574-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Grok Bot desktop on Windows.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIn a chat, locate the vertical divider between the chat pane and the agent computer / right info pane.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDrag the divider all the way to the right.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eObserve that the right pane disappears and no monitor / computer icon is available in the top-right or elsewhere to reopen it.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-499574-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-499574-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhen the right pane (agent computer preview / info pane) is collapsed, show the monitor icon (or equivalent) so the user can reopen it. Collapsing via the divider should not permanently hide reopen UI.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-499574-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-499574-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWindows 10/11\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-499574-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-499574-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot desktop for Windows; version not provided.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-499574-additional-information-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-499574-additional-information-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWorkarounds that still work:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eClick agent name in chat header\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCtrl+Shift+I\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDeep link: grokbot://app/v1/sidebar?tab=computer\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAsk:\u003c/strong\u003e Please restore a visible monitor/computer control whenever the right pane is hidden.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReported via agent Adam on behalf of Constantin Philippou (explicit ask to file).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-499574-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-499574-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-24T01:41:55.192Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":11,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":55.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":172842,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-windows-collapsing-chat-computer-divider-hides-right-pane-with-no-monitor-icon-to-reopen","display_username":"Constantin Philippou","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":139505,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-windows-collapsing-chat-computer-divider-hides-right-pane-with-no-monitor-icon-to-reopen/172842/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":499580,"name":"Kevin Neilson","username":"kevinn","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/kevinn/{size}/101206_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-24T01:52:17.140Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/conszi\"\u003e@conszi\u003c/a\u003e Thanks for the post!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe screen view moved rather than went away. In 0.58.0, the separate computer button in the top right was folded into the Bot’s name at the top center of the chat. To get back to it:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen the Bot’s chat.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eClick the Bot’s name at the top center of the window. A panel opens on the right showing the Bot’s settings.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eClick the back arrow (“Back to details”) at the top left of that panel.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe live screen preview is at the top of the panel. Click it to open the full computer view.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou can also toggle that panel with \u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCtrl+Alt+B (the windows command)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-24T01:53:23.414Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":2,"readers_count":1,"score":0.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":172842,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-windows-collapsing-chat-computer-divider-hides-right-pane-with-no-monitor-icon-to-reopen","display_username":"Kevin Neilson","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":105146,"hidden":false,"trust_level":3,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-windows-collapsing-chat-computer-divider-hides-right-pane-with-no-monitor-icon-to-reopen/172842/5","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null}],"stream":[499574,499580]},"timeline_lookup":[[1,1]],"suggested_topics":[],"tags":[{"id":416,"name":"grok-bot","slug":"grok-bot"},{"id":290,"name":"layout","slug":"layout"}],"